          "Start with the groupBy/agg pattern: `gps_data.groupBy('distribution_center_id').agg(F.countDistinct('truck_id').alias('total_trucks'), F.avg('speed_mph').alias('avg_speed'), ...)`. For active trucks specifically, you need to filter first: `active_trucks = gps_data.filter(F.col('is_moving') == True).groupBy('distribution_center_id').agg(F.countDistinct('truck_id').alias('active_trucks'))`.",
