          "Example for the two-stage approach:\n```python\n# Stage 1: per-truck metrics\ntruck_metrics = gps_data.groupBy('distribution_center_id', 'truck_id').agg(\n    F.count('*').alias('total_pings'),\n    F.sum(F.when(F.col('is_moving'), 1).otherwise(0)).alias('moving_pings'),\n    F.min('fuel_level_pct').alias('min_fuel'),\n    F.max('fuel_level_pct').alias('max_fuel')\n)\n# Stage 2: per-center averages\ncenter_kpis = truck_metrics.groupBy('distribution_center_id').agg(\n    F.count('truck_id').alias('total_trucks'),\n    F.avg(F.col('moving_pings') / F.col('total_pings')).alias('avg_utilization_rate'),\n    F.avg(F.col('max_fuel') - F.col('min_fuel')).alias('avg_fuel_consumption_delta')\n)\n```"
