        aiPrompt: "Review the user's TypeScript Function for getting available trucks. Check: Is the @Function decorator used correctly? Are all filter conditions implemented (status=active, no current shipment, no upcoming maintenance)? Is the sorting by mileage ascending? Is pagination supported? Are TypeScript types correct? Is the function handling the case where no trucks are available? Is the Ontology query pattern correct for Foundry Functions? Suggest improvements for robustness and performance."
